# RoamAround AI + Route Optimization Integration Walkthrough

## Summary of Completed Integration
The deterministic Route Optimizer and AI Concierge layer have been cleanly integrated into the RoamAround application across the FastAPI backend and React frontend. 

The system strictly adheres to the core invariants:
1. **Guaranteed Round-Trip**: All routes strictly start and terminate at the user's origin ($START \rightarrow \text{Stops} \rightarrow START$).
2. **Deterministic Time-Budget Constraint**: $\text{Total Duration} \le \text{Available Time}$, managed via algorithmic Orienteering Problem optimization with realistic travel times and dynamic dwell times.
3. **Single Source of Truth**: The deterministic optimizer and Google Routes API govern all route points, coordinates, and timings; AI LLM services provide grounded enrichment and conversational re-optimization without fabricating coordinates.
4. **Backward Compatibility**: Existing frontend calls (`POST /api/generate-route` with legacy fields) and new unified contracts (`POST /api/plan-trip`) are both fully supported with zero regressions.

